# Entry sets pushed over from the Sim tool for pre-lock grading — per-slate,
# cleared with the slate. Every other data/ per-slate store is ignored; this one
# was missed, so Sim-pushed portfolios sat here untracked and would ride along on
# any future `git add -A`.
data/sim_entries/

# Pasted-lineup drafts for the Grade tab — per-slate scratch, cleared with the
# slate. Every other per-slate data/ store is ignored; this one was missed.
data/grade_drafts/

# Sim-pushed per-slate hand-off payloads + per-contest pick artifacts (8/10/26
# sweep — four more per-slate stores had been missed since the sim_entries
# note above; data/sim_pool alone is a ~2 MB JSON that must never ride a
# `git add -A`). All are cleared with the slate.
data/sim_pool/
data/sim_autopsy/
data/sim_standings/
data/lineup_selection/
data/grade/

# Local archives of cleared slate workspaces (e.g. the unlogged 8/15/26
# NASCAR files) — user data, never repo history.
data/archive/
